# =============================================================================
# This repository versions the shared design system and its tooling.
# Everything else in this workspace directory belongs to other projects and is
# deliberately excluded — see docs or ask before widening this list.
# =============================================================================

# --- Allow-list approach: ignore everything, then un-ignore what we own ------
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.github/
!/design-system/
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json
!/docs/

# --- Within the tracked paths, still exclude the usual noise -----------------
node_modules/
dist/
.next/
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Transient Figma variable export used by design-system/scripts/import-figma-tokens.mjs
design-system/tokens/.figma-variables-export.json

# --- Verification reports: regenerated on every run -------------------------
# These carry a generatedAt timestamp (so any run dirties the tree) and embed
# full file listings of the PRIVATE app repositories. Keep them out of a public
# history; CI uploads them as build artifacts instead.
design-system/verification/reports/
